  "details": "The game world “Steel N Gold” is nonfunctional for quest users. When hosting events, Quest users from most headset variations reported flashing lights which could cause epilepsy, lagging, crashing, items and players frozen in place or non-interactable, screen issues that cause head-acks, eye strain, Screen taring, freezing which could result in users being kicked out of VRC altogether, Blackboxing “A thing for quest, it’s basically showing you to the brink of crashing and you can look behind you to see the same vision but upsidedown”. On the PC side I noticed the heavy crashing of quest users as well as items being D-synced where they would be unusable and disappear altogether. This started sometime before the 08/01/2024 update. My group tried to host an event their short after this update where most of these issues where still present or have gotten worse. I was waiting to see if a fix would come out for this but it’s now the end of the month so I’m reporting the issue now.",
